# SiteSaathi — Google Drive Web OAuth Client Configuration
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Required for optional manual Google Drive backup on Web/PWA.
# Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID in Google Cloud Console:
# 1. Application Type: Web application
# 2. Authorized JavaScript Origins:
#    - http://localhost:5173 (Local development)
#    - https://<your-production-domain> (Production)
# 3. Authorized Redirect URIs:
#    - http://localhost:5173
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER add a Google Client Secret here or to any frontend code!
# SiteSaathi is a public client; client secrets are strictly forbidden.

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
